  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Private sector support for generation of new jobs</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project is to support the growth of the private sector and create new jobs. More specifically, the project will support persons with disabilities in development of their entrepreneurial skills and creation of their new start-ups, through variety of support activities starting with the individual functional assessment of the persons with disabilities, entrepreneurship training, business plan development, additional employment, and procurement of equipment and materials f</narrative>
  </description>
